                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LESSON 05 / ENGLISH COURSE
120 x 60 mm XY plate; h=6 mm; t=2 mm; steel; left edge fixed; total force (0,-100,0) N.
Set Boundary, Fixed edge and Load point from the shared lesson 01 Rhino model.
WIRED SOLUTION. Select geometry, then run stages in order.
Files contain no completed runtime jobs. RUN/STOP/RESET are momentary buttons; no calculation starts automatically.
Mode 0 baseline -&gt; Mode 1 optimisation -&gt; Mode 2 binary verification. Threshold=0.40. Preserve attachments is enabled.
Open the unified manual for the full recipe, expected values and limitations.</item>
